useSelectedVehicle() returns { vehicleId: number | null, vehicle }.
withAiFeature(featureID, Component) HOC wraps with the required
  data-testid="ai-feature-{featureID}-root" + data-ai-feature attribute,
  consulting useSettings.ai_mode (must be non-'off') AND
  useSettings.ai_features[featureID] (must be truthy).

